g and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Sales Representative at Entry Level level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. No employment history required; study, training and hypothetical examples accepted. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":2,"kind":"Technical","competency":"Workflow and controls","weight":15,"ar":"كيف تنفذ عملية تأهيل عميل محتمل وإعداد عرض مناسب من البداية إلى النهاية؟ وضح خطواتك وما ستطلب فيه مساعدة المشرف.","en":"How would you qualify a prospect and prepare a suitable proposal from start to finish? Explain your steps and when you would seek supervisor help.","points":["Understand need","verify fit and budget","record next step","Recognize limits and seek appropriate help"],"ideal":"فهم الحاجة؛ التحقق من الملاءمة والميزانية؛ توثيق الخطوة التالية","difficulty":"Basic","seconds":120,"keywords":["Understand need","verify fit and budget","record next step","Recognize limits and seek appropriate help"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Sales Representative at Entry Level level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. No employment history required; study, training and hypothetical examples accepted. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":3,"kind":"Technical","competency":"Incident judgment","weight":15,"ar":"عميل يطلب خصمًا خارج صلاحيتك ويهدد بالشراء من منافس. ما التصرف المناسب؟ وضح خطواتك وما ستطلب فيه مساعدة المشرف.","en":"A customer demands a discount outside your authority and threatens to buy elsewhere. What would you do? Explain your steps and when you would seek supervisor help.","points":["Explore the objection","explain value without unauthorized promises","escalate for approval","Recognize limits and seek appropriate help"],"ideal":"استكشاف سبب الاعتراض؛ توضيح القيمة دون وعد غير معتمد؛ التصعيد لصاحب الصلاحية","difficulty":"Basic","seconds":120,"keywords":["Explore the objection","explain value without unauthorized promises","escalate for approval","Recognize limits and seek appropriate help"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Sales Representative at Entry Level level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. No employment history required; study, training and hypothetical examples accepted. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":4,"kind":"Technical","competency":"Quality measurement","weight":1